This one is a Language-Selector.
And also define your own default language in ESO using in-game addon only. without using external UserSettings. Even if you turn off ESO client, your last language code are restored at next time.
Language codes are 5 bundled languages(en, de, fr, jp, ru) and user defined codes. the code can be modified via settings > addons.

[B]DependsOn:[/B]

